
~ start

match interaction_count
	when 1
		PLUM: There's a man on the poster... (suprised)
		VINCENT: Some news about some man wanted for kidnappings. (serious)
		PLUM: Is that the same man you're after? (thinking)
		VINCENT: I don't think this is an appropiate conversation for you. (angry)
		=> END

	else
		You look at the newspaper.
		There's a girl in it.
		You wonder if her name is rosie...
		VINCENT: Stop messing about.
		=> END
